<div id="u-credit-00488-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yangyihua" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(7144335); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7144335&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608905328" alt="yangyihua" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7144335)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yangyihua" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(7144335); return false;">yangyihua</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1608541696 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">21 Dec 2020 09:08</span></p>
